{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1000_p", "source_sha256": "59f172ea8e02080b6de03413a6db7400d2a371e2bb4f6146c5659650309e698b", "ja": "（クリスマス街頭ライブは、大成功で終わった。\nサンタ衣装のひなたは、お客さんに好評だったな！）", "zh": "（圣诞街头演出圆满结束了。\n穿着圣诞老人服装的日向很受观众欢迎啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1001_p", "source_sha256": "62c341c6de657790bf8c7ec5a31ed2f2ac756940ef916128dde68bda06f0c0cd", "ja": "お疲れさま、ひなた。寒くなかったか？\n動いているとはいえ、屋外のステージだからな。", "zh": "辛苦了，日向。没觉得冷吧？\n虽然一直在活动，但毕竟是户外舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "922d8284dfad384317ef96b877b3957d6670408698df0a7612d232f1ff66ad65", "ja": "ううん、大丈夫だよぉ。寒いのは慣れっこだべさ。\n心配してくれて、ありがとねぇ。", "zh": "不会，我没事啦～。寒冷什么的早就习惯了。\n谢谢你替我担心呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "23bc7db71f94bc8c3db1c82389c707978bbf3e1247967ac17ec7e81a260681f5", "ja": "ライブでちょっこし汗をかいたから、\n身体が冷えないよう気をつけねば。……そうだ！", "zh": "因为刚才在演唱会上出了点汗，得注意别让身体着凉才行。……对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "9c4c5ebcfbb7e5b2855b3c497073c5c87df8cf7909f92420e0ef2a471a6314d0", "ja": "さっき{$P$}にもらったマフラー、\n早速、使ってもいいかい？", "zh": "刚才{$P$}送给我的围巾，现在就用起来，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0bce07edbfc878f46615c9fd62b0bdf677c9aa9e641b98458bd94a44215d5bbe", "ja": "もちろんだよ。\nひなたに気に入ってもらえるといいんだけど。", "zh": "当然可以了。\n要是你能喜欢就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "81542078b7f1879ab3ce745a8bf054b00b727b85d1c9256af1a1d833c4d09cda", "ja": "心配しなくても、大丈夫。\nクマさんの顔がかわいくて、大好きだよぉ。", "zh": "不用担心，没关系的。\n小熊的脸很可爱，我好喜欢呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "89942dff72f9b56a9bb339b80d6b1cb73a89d4fca6d98b90da3a67b45cad365b", "ja": "それに、{$P$}があたしのために\n選んでくれたって言うのが嬉しいんだわぁ。", "zh": "而且，{$P$}是你特意为我挑选的，想到这一点就觉得好开心呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6f790b12b13a445551cfbe14cd38b272f1cf21114345bcba269f94202eb03650", "ja": "そう言ってもらえると、悩んだ甲斐があるな。\nひなたがセーターを編んでたから、似合うと思って。", "zh": "听你这么说，我之前的纠结也算值得了。\n因为看到小日向在织毛衣，我觉得这件很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "f5c8c3b920b6c566359fb61779a3cc2d115049e7855cbf0301131f6a6d14b9af", "ja": "えっ？　あ、あれはあたしのじゃなくて……\n大切な人にあげるために編んでたんだ。", "zh": "诶？啊、那个不是给我的……  \n是为了送给重要的人才织的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1841863bee2a65937cacb2c63122615e08495cdb09a16a576c1a665ce1358ab4", "ja": "そ、そうだったのか！　てっきり、ひなたのかと。\nもしかして、北海道のおばあちゃんとかか？", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊！我还以为是给日向的呢。难道是给北海道的奶奶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "7869d3770ec05ffa7649038b2c9012760ee4970df9cbd29bac1e07f3a68a9a4b", "ja": "ううん。もちろん、おばあちゃんも大切な人だよ。\nでもこのセーターは……{$P$}に。", "zh": "不是的。当然，奶奶也是对我来说很重要的人哦。\n不过这件毛衣是……给{$P$}的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_1012", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_2000_p", "source_sha256": "ca8c8baba574642ece3a2ee9579a2e7c995a4845f8f92f53190611762299d989", "ja": "俺のために。本当にいいのか？", "zh": "为了我？真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_2001_035hin", "source_sha256": "70a12fff1ff807b8eedc70dc8d733dd5153995f226baf671490774960e1680d8", "ja": "うん。いつも助けてもらってるからねぇ。\n何をプレゼントするか、ちょっこし悩んだけど……。", "zh": "嗯。因为平时总是受到你的照顾嘛。\n虽然为了送什么礼物，稍微烦恼了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_2002_035hin", "source_sha256": "6613696c6693714f5c6f6deadc70ddb67925102fb34ec33199e3c932496e1ef7", "ja": "お礼の気持ちも込めて、一生けんめい編んだんだ。\nいつもありがとねぇ、{$P$}。", "zh": "也倾注了我的谢意，我可是拼命织出来的哦。\n一直以来谢谢你啦，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_2003_p", "source_sha256": "f8abdb0ed2be2d31d26c77b0ae1ee8925ff5fab3cebde1a13591a6b17b2071e9", "ja": "ひなた……。こちらこそ、ありがとう。\nそれじゃ俺も、すぐに着てみようかな。", "zh": "日向……我才该说谢谢。那我也现在就穿上试试吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0343_2004_035hin", "source_sha256": "e5f4e629941f972c66d046e62ee1d24b545d4a4b24418ea45a830cc847073ff0", "ja": "こ、ここで着るのは、ちょっこし恥ずかしいべさ……。\nできれば、お家で開けてくれないかい？", "zh": "在、在这里穿上，有点不好意思……  \n可以的话，能回家再打开吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
